# safe-qwen S-A2 (2026-10-08, REVIEW_20261008 A2): _p plus the FIFO's 2-level REGISTERED read select (PIPE=2: level 1 <= 4:1 per
# group by a kept per-128-b-slice head-pointer copy, captured every rclk; level 2 2:1 by a kept group-index copy) and the output
# station of _p; +1 rclk per channel on the read face (+3 rclk vs PIPE=0).  CDC check (4_cts.odb of _p-3d5ad2a4ftt, sign-off
# SDC at FF): no cross-clock hold violation; every violating hold path is same-clock (odp->port, od_q->odp): no exception missing.
# qwen-blocks qfd_io_xfifo_p: every channel PIPE=1 (pin relay, wide async FIFO with registered write + per-slice read-pointer copies, enable-free output capture, output pin station)
# r21 master qfd_io_xfifo (400.008 x 1563.816): ot_qwen_die_io_xfifo, five credit CDC channels (ck / cku / cks / ckd);
# multi-clock kit physical/qwen_die_masters/mc/qfd_io_xfifo (every port inter-region, 150 ps).
TOP=ot_qwen_die_io_xfifo
SRCS='rtl/physical/ot_qwen_die_io_xfifo.sv rtl/physical/ot_qwen_die_cdc_ch.sv rtl/physical/ot_qwen_async_fifo_w.sv rtl/lib/ot_async_fifo.sv rtl/lib/ot_reset_sync.sv'
PARAMS=(--param PIPE=2)
FW=400.008
FH=1563.816
PINS=(--pin-region '^o_seq_coll(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=left:250-350' --pin-region '^i_ucie_tx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=left:700-860' --pin-region '^o_ucie_rx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=left:940-1100' --pin-region '^i_serdes_tx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=left:1140-1300' --pin-region '^o_serdes_rx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=left:1310-1470' --pin-region '^o_ucie_tx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=right:700-860' --pin-region '^i_ucie_rx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=right:940-1100' --pin-region '^o_serdes_tx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=bottom:10-130' --pin-region '^i_serdes_rx(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=bottom:140-260' --pin-region '^i_seq_coll(_v|_cr)?(\[|$)=bottom:270-330' --pin-region '^(ck|cku|cks|ckd|rst_n|fault_ck|fault_cku|fault_cks|fault_ckd)$=top:20-380')
INTER='*'
REFGLOB='*od_q*'
CLKPORT=ck
QDMD=/src/physical/qwen_die_masters/mc/qfd_io_xfifo
SDCF=plain.sdc
PD=0.55
NC=16
MACROS=()
EXTRA=()
STAGES=synth,pnr
